# preserve-primary-failure-diagnostics — History

## v1.0.0 (2026-09-15)

**Change:** Created the canonical rule for a failed operation followed by a failed reconciliation
probe.

**Provenance:** A privacy-safe automation session supplied the failure evidence. The initial
operation produced useful diagnostics. A later state probe failed and replaced that evidence until
the failure boundary preserved both causes. Focused failure-route tests and exact-source continuous
integration passed.

**Archive result:** Initial version. No prior version exists.
